### WD-1750 - Bulk Data unificado (un solo SP transaccional)
### Caso 1: referencias existentes por locationId y por privateCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-1750 existentes",
    "startDate": "2026-08-06T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-08-06T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "radius": 100,
            "minTime": 10,
            "maxTime": 30
        },
        {
            "privateCode": "REF-EXISTENTE",
            "minTime": 15,
            "maxTime": 45
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 2: creación de referencia nueva con cliente (locationsCreated = 1)
### Verificar en DB: Locations con CustomerId, org del cliente, UserLocations, AuditCreateSourceId = 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-1750 creación",
    "startDate": "2026-08-06T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-08-06T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "privateCode": "REF-NUEVA-001",
            "locationName": "Referencia nueva WD-1750",
            "latitude": 14.6349,
            "longitude": -90.5069,
            "radius": 100,
            "customerPrivateCode": "CLI-001"
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 3: creación solo con dirección (sin coordenadas) → se crea en 0,0
### locationsCreatedWithoutCoordinates = 1; la geocodificación en background la completará (pendiente WD-1688)
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-1750 solo dirección",
    "startDate": "2026-08-06T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-08-06T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "privateCode": "REF-NUEVA-002",
            "locationName": "Referencia solo dirección",
            "locationAddress": "4a avenida 15-45 zona 10, Guatemala",
            "radius": 80
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 4: fila inválida (sin privateCode ni datos para crear) → 400 y NO se crea nada
### Verificar en DB que no quedó Visita huérfana (rollback total)
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-1750 inválido",
    "startDate": "2026-08-06T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-08-06T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "privateCode": "REF-NUEVA-003",
            "locationName": "Referencia válida",
            "latitude": 14.6349,
            "longitude": -90.5069
        },
        {
            "locationName": "Sin privateCode ni coordenadas ni dirección"
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 5: referencia duplicada en el payload → se deduplica (no truena la PK de VisitaPunto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-1750 duplicada",
    "startDate": "2026-08-06T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-08-06T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "minTime": 10
        },
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "minTime": 20
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 6: unidad inexistente → 400 Unit not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "NO-EXISTE",
    "workplanName": "WD-1750 unidad inválida",
    "startDate": "2026-08-06T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-08-06T18:00:00",
    "locations": []
}

### WD-2553 - Pedidos por ubicación
### Caso 7: pedido nuevo y pedido existente por orderId
### El número S00042 no existe en el catálogo y se crea (Source = WorkplanExecution);
### la orden 1001 ya existe y solo se vincula.
### Esperado: ordersLinked = 2, ordersCreated = 1, unresolvedOrders = []
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 pedidos",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "radius": 100,
            "orders": [
                { "orderNumber": "S00042", "volume": 10 },
                { "orderId": 1001, "volume": 4 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 8: venta con dos despachos, desambiguados con dispatchNumber
### Cada despacho es una orden distinta del catálogo y se vincula por separado.
### Esperado: ordersLinked = 2, ordersCreated = 0, dos filas en WorkplanExecutionOrders
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 dos despachos",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "radius": 100,
            "orders": [
                { "orderNumber": "S00042", "dispatchNumber": "WH/OUT/00042", "volume": 6 },
                { "orderNumber": "S00042", "dispatchNumber": "WH/OUT/00043", "volume": 4 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 9: desambiguación por externalDispatchId (id del despacho en el origen)
### Esperado: ordersLinked = 1, ordersCreated = 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 por externalDispatchId",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "radius": 100,
            "orders": [
                { "externalDispatchId": "7001", "volume": 3 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 10: venta con varios despachos SIN desambiguador → 400 ambiguousOrders
### La validación ocurre antes de abrir la transacción: NO se crea el plan.
### Esperado: message con los despachos candidatos en formato orderId:dispatchNumber
### Verificar en DB que no quedó Visita nueva para la unidad
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 ambigua",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "radius": 100,
            "orders": [
                { "orderNumber": "S00042", "volume": 10 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 11: ambigüedad en la segunda ubicación → tampoco se crea la primera
### Comprueba que el rechazo es transaccional para todo el payload
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 ambigua parcial",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        { "locationId": 1, "radius": 100, "orders": [ { "orderId": 1001, "volume": 1 } ] },
        { "locationId": 2, "radius": 100, "orders": [ { "orderNumber": "S00042", "volume": 2 } ] }
    ]
}

### Caso 12: referencia que no resuelve ni se puede crear (sin orderNumber)
### Un pedido no resuelto NO impide crear el plan; se reporta con su motivo.
### Esperado: workPlanExecutionId válido, ordersLinked = 1 y unresolvedOrders con la entrada descartada
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 no resuelta",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "radius": 100,
            "orders": [
                { "orderId": 1001, "volume": 1 },
                { "externalId": "999999", "volume": 2 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 13: el mismo pedido en dos ubicaciones del payload → gana la primera
### Esperado: ordersLinked = 1 y unresolvedOrders con la entrada duplicada
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 duplicada",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        { "locationId": 1, "radius": 100, "orders": [ { "orderId": 1002, "volume": 5 } ] },
        { "locationId": 2, "radius": 100, "orders": [ { "orderId": 1002, "volume": 5 } ] }
    ]
}

### Caso 14: lista de pedidos vacía → equivalente a omitirla en creación
### En un plan nuevo no hay nada que quitar. Esperado: ordersLinked = 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 orders vacío",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        { "locationId": 1, "radius": 100, "orders": [] }
    ]
}

### Caso 15: volume negativo → 400 por validación del modelo
### Lo rechaza [Range] antes de llegar al wrapper
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-2553 volume negativo",
    "startDate": "2026-09-15T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-15T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationId": 1,
            "radius": 100,
            "orders": [
                { "orderId": 1001, "volume": -1 }
            ]
        }
    ]
}

### WD-3859 - privateCode autogenerado
### Caso 16: ubicaciones nuevas sin privateCode → código determinístico AUTO-...
### Mismo nombre, distinta ubicación → dos referencias. La primera por coordenadas, la
### segunda solo con dirección (se crea en 0,0).
### Esperado: locationsCreated = 2, generatedPrivateCodes = ["1:AUTO-...", "2:AUTO-..."]
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-3859 códigos generados",
    "startDate": "2026-09-25T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-25T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationName": "Walmart WD-3859",
            "latitude": 14.5987654,
            "longitude": -90.5512345,
            "locationAddress": "Calzada Roosevelt"
        },
        {
            "locationName": "Walmart WD-3859",
            "locationAddress": "Condado Concepción"
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 17: reenvío del caso 16 → reutiliza las referencias (no duplica)
### Las coordenadas cambian después del 4.º decimal y el nombre trae espacios extra.
### Esperado: locationsResolved = 2, locationsCreated = 0 y los MISMOS generatedPrivateCodes del caso 16
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-3859 reenvío",
    "startDate": "2026-09-25T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-25T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationName": "Walmart WD-3859",
            "latitude": 14.59876,
            "longitude": -90.55123
        },
        {
            "locationName": "  Walmart WD-3859 ",
            "locationAddress": "Condado Concepción"
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 18: 0,0 explícito cuenta como "sin coordenadas" → se usa la dirección
### Esperado: locationsResolved = 1 con el mismo código de la ubicación 2 del caso 16
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-3859 cero cero",
    "startDate": "2026-09-25T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-25T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "locationName": "Walmart WD-3859",
            "latitude": 0,
            "longitude": 0,
            "locationAddress": "Condado Concepción"
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 19: privateCode "undefined" se trata como no enviado → se genera AUTO-...
### No se enlaza a ninguna de las referencias existentes con código 'undefined'.
### Esperado: locationsCreated = 1 y generatedPrivateCodes con la posición 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-3859 undefined",
    "startDate": "2026-09-25T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-25T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        {
            "privateCode": "undefined",
            "locationName": "Otra WD-3859",
            "latitude": 14.61,
            "longitude": -90.52
        }
    ]
}

### Caso 20: horarios en la zona de startDate; hora sin fecha toma la fecha de startDate
### Ventana nocturna 22:00-02:00 → termina al día siguiente. Fecha fuera del plan → fecha de startDate.
### Verificar en DB VisitaPunto.plan_hora_min/max = fecha del plan + hora local de la unidad
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-3859 horarios",
    "startDate": "2026-09-26T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-26T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        { "locationId": 1, "minHour": "2026-09-26T08:00:00", "maxHour": "2026-09-26T17:30:00" },
        { "privateCode": "REF-EXISTENTE", "minHour": "2026-01-15T22:00:00", "maxHour": "2026-01-15T02:00:00" }
    ]
}

### Caso 21: ubicación repetida con pedidos distintos → una parada, pedidos concatenados
### Esperado: una sola parada (datos de la primera aparición) con los dos pedidos vinculados
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/bulkData
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "unitPrivateCode": "U-001",
    "workplanName": "WD-3859 repetida con pedidos",
    "startDate": "2026-09-26T08:00:00",
    "endDate": "2026-09-26T18:00:00",
    "locations": [
        { "locationId": 1, "radius": 100, "orders": [ { "orderNumber": "S00101", "volume": 1 } ] },
        { "locationId": 1, "radius": 100, "orders": [ { "orderNumber": "S00102", "volume": 2 } ] }
    ]
}
